  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPledgedAssetsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;４．担保資産及び担保付債務&lt;/p&gt;
